abstract: >-
  MATLAB simulations, native-chart postprocessing, and publication figures and
  tables for shared control errors in single-image space resection with
  self-calibration. Includes compact retained numerical evidence and a
  resumable pipeline for generating fresh experiments.
keywords:
  - photogrammetry
  - space resection
  - self-calibration
  - correlated control
  - uncertainty
  - Gauss-Helmert model
